			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 715350201,
					"content": "#Fancy seeing you in these parts, {NICKNAME}. You must be here for Lantern Rite, too!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dehya"
				},
				{
					"id": 715350202,
					"content": "Are you making a gift envelope?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 715350203,
					"content": "Yeah, I'm trying make one for Candace, but I'm not happy with the result so far. I was just about to start from scratch.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dehya"
				},
				{
					"id": 715350204,
					"content": "Did Candace not come with you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 715350205,
					"content": "Not yet, but she'll be here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dehya"
				},
				{
					"id": 715350206,
					"content": "She didn't agree to come with me to Liyue at first. Said she had to stay behind to protect the village.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dehya"
				},
				{
					"id": 715350207,
					"content": "I told her everyone deserves to let loose at the end of the year. I had to escort a caravan to Liyue, anyway, so she might as well come along.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dehya"
				},
				{
					"id": 715350208,
					"content": "I even offered for some of my guys to look after the village in the meantime.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dehya"
				},
				{
					"id": 715350209,
					"content": "But, I couldn't convince her. In the end, she only changed her mind because the people in the village pestered her to take time off.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dehya"
				},
				{
					"id": 715350210,
					"content": "Even then, she still insisted on wrapping up some work first.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dehya"
				},
				{
					"id": 715350211,
					"content": "But, the caravan waits for no one... So, I'm here on my own for now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dehya"
				},
				{
					"id": 715350212,
					"content": "It was so hard to pick out a gift — there are just too many nice things to choose from around here!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dehya"
				},
				{
					"id": 715350213,
					"content": "I ended up getting her a necklace, but then I heard about the whole gift envelope tradition during Lantern Rite, so I decided to try making one.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dehya"
				},
				{
					"id": 715350214,
					"content": "And, well... Like I said, it hasn't been going great.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dehya"
				},
				{
					"id": 715350215,
					"content": "#I'm sure you know more about this than me, {NICKNAME}. Can you give me some tips?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						715350216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dehya"
				},
				{
					"id": 715350216,
					"content": "No problem, let me take a look...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
